{"about_the_game":"In this demo for tactical martial arts roguelike Forestrike, you can get an early taste of the game\u2019s unique Foresight ability. Practice a battle as many times as you like in your mind\u2014but if you're defeated in the actual fight, your run ends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOld Master Talgun, who rejects violence and believes the will to harm is a negative force, will teach you the advanced techniques of the Leaf style, a school of martial arts focusing on defence and evasion. It is one of five schools, and the demo will be updated with other kung-fu masters over time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMastering the Leaf style will allow you to deftly evade and manipulate your opponent\u2019s positioning and attacks, disarm or turn their weapons against them, and capitalize on their mistakes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTest your martial arts prowess ahead of Forestrike\u2019s launch later this year.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2325930?t=1742837475","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2325930?t=1742837475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325930/d596c77b3a9a1523dc4029f497b5cc4615df7bd4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742837475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325930/d596c77b3a9a1523dc4029f497b5cc4615df7bd4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742837475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"In this demo for tactical martial arts roguelike Forestrike, you can get an early taste of the game\u2019s unique Foresight ability. Practice a battle as many times as you like in your mind\u2014but if you're defeated in the actual fight, your run ends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOld Master Talgun, who rejects violence and believes the will to harm is a negative force, will teach you the advanced techniques of the Leaf style, a school of martial arts focusing on defence and evasion. It is one of five schools, and the demo will be updated with other kung-fu masters over time.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMastering the Leaf style will allow you to deftly evade and manipulate your opponent\u2019s positioning and attacks, disarm or turn their weapons against them, and capitalize on their mistakes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTest your martial arts prowess ahead of Forestrike\u2019s launch later this year.","developers":["Skeleton Crew Studio","Thomas Olsson"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2325920","name":"Forestrike"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325930/930a1f177394ab32f57a02a436e01fab1b7816b2/header.jpg?t=1742837475","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113501,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113501/movie480.mp4?t=1742826803","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113501/movie_max.mp4?t=1742826803"},"name":"Leaf School Combat Overview","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113501/a29d0caee6c34bedee60d26c46e0c28670d03dc2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742826803","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113501/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742826803","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113501/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742826803"}}],"name":"Forestrike Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<stron